    \xE7\u0131kacak; | Bakal\u0131m ne \xE7\u0131kacak;}} {{kelime, aa, \"Denge\"
    kart\u0131 d\xFCz a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131. \u0130\u015F hayat\u0131nda \xE7al\u0131\u015Ft\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    ki\u015Filerle bir konuda orta yolu bulacak, a\u015Fk hayat\u0131nda ise sevgilinle
    i\xE7indeki baz\u0131 gizli duygular\u0131 payla\u015Facaks\u0131n. | aa, \"Denge\"
    kart\u0131 ters a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131. \u0130\u015F hayat\u0131nda seni huzursuz
    eden bir insanla kar\u015F\u0131 kar\u015F\u0131ya gelip konu\u015Fabilir, a\u015Fk
    hayat\u0131nda ise sevgilinle arandaki bir problemi orta yol bularak \xE7\xF6z\xFCmleyebilirsin.
    | \"D\xFCnya\" kart\u0131 senin i\xE7in d\xFCz a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131. \u0130\u015F
    hayat\u0131nda kalk\u0131\u015Faca\u011F\u0131n bir i\u015Fi ba\u015Far\u0131yla
    noktalayacak, a\u015Fk hayat\u0131nda ise sevgilinle daha huzurlu g\xFCnlere
    do\u011Fru ilerleyeceksin. | \"D\xFCnya\" kart\u0131 senin i\xE7in ters a\xE7\u0131ld\u0131.
    \u0130\u015Finle ilgili hayal k\u0131r\u0131kl\u0131\u011F\u0131 ya\u015Fad\u0131\u011F\u0131n
    bir konuyu yeniden ele alacak, a\u015Fk hayat\u0131nda ise sevgilinle s\xFCrekli
    tart\u0131\u015F\u0131p durdu\u011Fun bir meseleyi nihayet tatl\u0131ya ba\u011Flayacaks\u0131n.}}
